@Axel and @tasha will be using metta/ train to train RL on cogs-vs-clips. This looks like starting from this command: uv run ./tools/run.py experiments.recipes.cvc.small_maps.train run=my_small_maps_run num_cogs=4 variants='["lonely_heart","heart_chorus","pack_rat","neutral_faced"]' and then gradually working up to harder settings. Specifically: 
    small_maps -> large_maps -> etc.,
    also, reducing from 4 variants to ideally 0.

